2026-09-10T21:35:56.8611270Z        simctl help [subcommand]
2026-09-10T21:35:56.8713500Z Command line utility to control the Simulator
2026-09-10T21:35:56.8814000Z 
2026-09-10T21:35:56.8916160Z For subcommands that require a <device> argument, you may specify a device UDID
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9019100Z or the special "booted" string which will cause simctl to pick a booted device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9119410Z If multiple devices are booted when the "booted" device is selected, simctl
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9220680Z will choose one of them.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9321670Z 
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9375280Z Subcommands:
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9377920Z 	addmedia            Add photos, live photos, videos, or contacts to the library of a device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9409100Z 	appinfo             Show information about an installed application.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9414090Z 	boot                Boot a device or device pair.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9414890Z 	clone               Clone an existing device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9415780Z 	create              Create a new device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9416690Z 	delete              Delete specified devices, unavailable devices, or all devices.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9417500Z 	diagnose            Collect diagnostic information and logs.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9419180Z 	erase               Erase a device's contents and settings.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9419890Z 	get_app_container   Print the path of the installed app's container
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9422480Z 	getenv              Print an environment variable from a running device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9423760Z 	help                Prints the usage for a given subcommand.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9424610Z 	icloud_sync         Trigger iCloud sync on a device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9426270Z 	install             Install an app on a device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9426960Z 	install_app_data    Install an xcappdata package to a device, replacing the current contents of the container.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9428100Z 	io                  Set up a device IO operation.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9428620Z 	keychain            Manipulate a device's keychain
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9429650Z 	launch              Launch an application by identifier on a device.
2026-09-10T21:35:56.9430430Z 	list                List available devices, device types, runtimes, or device pairs.
